### 1. List products (200, 5 products)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 2. Search by name (200, 1 product)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?q=laptop

### 3. Create a product (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teclado mecánico",
  "description": "Switches rojos",
  "price": 49.90,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "electronica"
}

### 4. Create an order (201 Created, total 1349.79)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### 5. Read the order back (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1

### 6. Not enough stock (409, nothing is taken from the stock)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 3, "quantity": 99 }
  ]
}

### 7. Unknown product in an order (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [ { "productId": 999, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### 8. Invalid order (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [] }

### 9. Delete a product that has orders (409)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 10. Delete a product without orders (204; repeat it and you get 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/5
